{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>What is this place? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>What is its purpose? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Why are you here?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>THE DREAMER</i></strong><i> lies until the work is completed.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Prismania</strong> is a surreal puzzle adventure game. After waking up in a strange triangle-shaped well full of strange mechanisms, you must solve prism puzzles to escape and figure out how you ended up there and what's going on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542240/extras/prismania_reveal_gif_1.gif?t=1742952045\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Move laser beams</strong> in dozens of boards with increasingly complex prism and modifier pieces. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb the well in which you are trapped while you discover <strong>cryptic surreal videos</strong> that will give a new perspective.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Videos, environment and boards. Everything is connected to provide <strong>complex and interesting puzzles</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Narrative without texts or dialogues</strong>. Interpret the facts and find out what is going on.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542240/extras/prismania_reveal_gif_2.gif?t=1742952045\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542240/extras/prismania_reveal_gif_3.gif?t=1742952045\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steams